# @longtokens before the @lexer section: it belongs in it.
# error: longtokens_preamble.grammar:4:1:
# error: @longtokens belongs in the @lexer section
@longtokens
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
top! = IDENT                                → (t 1)
